repair = "Shared nonblocking subprocess pipes cap stdout and stderr while running, apply an absolute deadline to reads, writes and exit wait, and kill the process group and reap the direct child on every exit; openssl and CommandProvider share the runner."

[finding.signer-concurrency-bound]
